{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e7f1669-1d35-88fd-88c6-6fe78db7369e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:08:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Donna Pellegrino. I manage a building at 402 Malbone Road, in the North End. I have a question about the recycling, what is allowed now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Donna, go ahead. What are you wondering about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pizza boxes, first. On the one hand, the tenants say they are cardboard so they go in. On the other hand, they are greasy. Then glass, and also those plastic clamshells from the grocery, the ones for salad and berries."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so pizza boxes, glass, clamshells. Let me pull up the sheet here. Generally a clean piece of the pizza box is fine, but the greasy bottom part should go in the trash. Glass bottles and jars are accepted, rinsed out. Clamshells, I'd want to check the plastic numbers with the hauler's list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the clamshells, you are not certain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I'm not going to say yes or no on those off the top of my head. Can I have a supervisor call you back with the exact answer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be good. I would like a supervisor to call me, please. [line breaks up] Hello? Are you still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. You cut out for a second. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0164. And if the line drops again, it is okay if I call back later? I am on my cell and the signal in this building is not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's fine. Just ask for Public Works and mention the recycling question. I'm writing it down: Donna Pellegrino, 402 Malbone Road, recycling rules, pizza boxes, glass, clamshells, supervisor to call back at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. That is everything. On the other hand, if they call and I miss it, I will try again Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. I'll put the note in today so it's there. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Kevin. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Donna. Take care."
    }
  ],
